    <ul class="timeline">
        <li class="timeline__item">
            <div class="timeline__date">
                <p class="timeline__dateTxt">2022-present</p>
                <div class="timeline__dot">
                    <div class="timeline__dotInner"></div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="timeline__card">
                <h3>Frontend Developer @@ Major Online Retailer</h3>
                <ul>
                    <li>
                        Build and maintains <b>frontend systems</b> for a <b>high-traffic e-commerce platform</b>
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        Develop <b>internal tools</b> and improves how teams work day-to-day
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        Implement <b>data layer</b> and <b>event tracking</b> for analytics and marketing (GTM)
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        Work with <b>APIs</b> and contribute to <b>backend development</b> when needed
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        Manage <b>domains, DNS</b>, and <b>self-hosted services</b>
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        Optimize <b>performance, debugging</b>, and <b>overall user experience</b>
                    </li>
                </ul>
            </div>
        </li>
        <li class="timeline__item">
            <div class="timeline__date">
                <p class="timeline__dateTxt">2021-2023</p>
